# CoverCall web app configuration. No secrets ever go to the browser.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL: the CoverCall api service. Locally: http://127.0.0.1:8080
#   (python -m evals.runners.dev_server). When unset, the app plays a recorded replay of real
#   local-run responses (badged "Recorded replay - not live"); taps that change state are disabled.
# The browser reads only through api's client-safe routes; it has no Firestore access
# (docs/decisions/0015-reads-through-api.md).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=""
